<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Koger Equity started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Koger Equity started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said it initiated coverage of Koger Equity Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 to 15-5/8 in morning American Stock Exchange trade.</p>
